      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALL THINGS GO (1) has mixed form recently, finishing fourth (18.81) in a Grade 5 at Wagga latest but did run well two back when in the frame. Better than latest and can atone here. FLYING SICARIO (2) turned in a moderate effort last time when seventh at Temora over 330m behind Effervescence (19.52) in a Grade 5. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Worth another chance. MELLCAT ABBY (3) has been out of the placings at her last couple but on the winners' heels when placing three back (20.16) in a Maiden at this track. Rates a winning chance on best. MARAVILLAS (8) did the right thing for favourite backers last time and another big run is on the cards.",
